WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:24.000
Terrifying Resurrection Combo

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:39.810
The Deck Master's ability, Reflector Hole.

00:01:40.110 --> 00:01:45.600
It reflects my attack back to me, damaging my life points.

00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:49.970
A political philosopher during the Italian Renaissance said,

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:53.690
“It's more effective to take advantage of an enemy than an ally.”

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.360
Another proverb?

00:01:56.800 --> 00:02:01.320
But due to your ability, your monsters are gone too!

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:04.240
My Battle Phase isn't over yet!

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:05.740
I'll attack you directly!

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:09.100
Go!  Obnoxious Celtic Guard!

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:14.710
That hurt.

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:18.350
I have more monsters than you.

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:22.190
I won't let you summon monsters to tribute!

00:02:23.230 --> 00:02:24.880
Are you sure?

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:29.220
Since I took damage, I can Special Summon a monster.

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:31.950
I summon Ruklamba the Spirit King.

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:34.560
What?

00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:38.100
He can summon that monster by taking damage?

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:49.980
When I take at least 1000 points of damage, I can summon another Ruklamba the Spirit King from my hand.

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:52.300
Remember that for next time.

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:57.400
No matter where I strike, his resurrection combo summons a monster to replace it.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:59.730
I can't be wasting time!

00:02:59.730 --> 00:03:02.470
If you're done, then end your turn.

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:04.800
I now know your defense is strong.

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:07.920
But you can't win if you only defend.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:12.470
“Defense is an easier and stronger battle strategy than attacking."

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:16.550
"But its purpose is passive and maintains the status quo."

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:18.680
That's what a general said.

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:22.120
Maintaining the status quo is an effective strategy.

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:24.050
You'll find out why.

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:27.490
I end my turn.

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:36.480
Don't waste the chance I gave you.

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:39.430
How are the others doing?

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:56.770
And...

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:11.770
Mom died, and Dad was killed in an accident.

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:19.270
Our relatives used up our Dad's inheritance and put us in an orphanage.

00:04:36.450 --> 00:04:38.220
What?  That's...

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:41.420
It's you and me.

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:02.540
I made a mountain!

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:03.940
You did!

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:10.820
I used to sit there reminiscing about my happy days with Dad and Mom.

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:24.840
Mokuba!

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:27.060
Big brother.

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:31.310
Let's go home, Mokuba.

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:43.450
Sorry, big brother.

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:47.110
If I went to the park where we used to play...

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:50.690
...I thought we could go back to the time when Dad was alive.

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:54.350
Mokuba, don't cry.

00:05:54.630 --> 00:05:56.600
I know how you feel.

00:05:56.600 --> 00:06:00.310
We're not losers.  We're not trash.

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:05.370
I'll get payback against those who put us in this position so that we can live a great life.

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:08.250
I'll be your dad from now on.

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:12.520
I'll protect you, no matter what.

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:14.320
Big brother...

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:16.940
So don't cry.  OK?

00:06:16.940 --> 00:06:19.400
Don't let your guard down.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:21.690
Showing weakness is fatal!

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:25.130
You used to say that all the time.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.640
Checkmate.

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:38.840
Again?

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:41.260
You're really tough!

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:49.190
Seto, the difference between reality and a dream is vague memories.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:55.130
Humans use memories as a springboard to reach greater heights.

00:06:56.000 --> 00:07:01.560
But vague memories are nothing more than electric signals in the brain.

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:05.500
Those sentimental emotions control you.

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:09.400
You're not fit to run Kaiba Corporation.

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:13.370
But I am because I'm superior to you.

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:18.600
I will thoroughly prove that to you.

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:25.390
You played with me often back then.

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:30.390
But on that day, you stopped smiling.

00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:36.830
The day he came to visit.

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:44.170
Kaiba Corporation president, Gozaburo Kaiba, won the World Chess Championship for the sixth time in a row.

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:51.630
Mr. Kaiba is donating the $100,000 grand prize to social services.

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:59.510
Yes.  My plan started at that moment, and it continues to this day.

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:06.770
That's him.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:15.070
Gozaburo Kaiba.

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:37.420
I'll fulfill my promise today, Mokuba.

00:08:37.420 --> 00:08:38.460
Big brother?

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.350
That's Gozaburo Kaiba.

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:43.900
The president of Kaiba Corporation.

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:46.310
He will adopt us.

00:08:46.310 --> 00:08:47.340
Adopt?

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:50.740
I'll make sure he adopts us.

00:08:50.740 --> 00:08:52.770
I'll force him to.

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:08.970
What is it?

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:12.630
Adopt me and my brother.

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:15.060
What did you say?

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:18.070
I said adopt us.

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:20.700
Not without conditions, of course.

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:24.010
Only if I defeat you in chess.

00:09:25.110 --> 00:09:26.740
You're amusing.

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:29.880
But that's a losing condition for you.

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:31.950
You won't be my son.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:36.890
You must know I've won the World Championship many times.

00:09:37.480 --> 00:09:39.560
You'll never defeat me.

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:41.990
There's no such thing as "never."

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:48.000
Chess has no randomness.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:52.600
I love chess because it's logical.

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:54.760
I don't care about that!

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:58.910
Will you accept my challenge or not?

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:02.480
I like the look in your eyes.

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:05.160
Fine.  I accept your challenge.

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:08.850
I'll adopt you if you win.  But...

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:10.820
I won't go easy on you!

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:13.020
Of course.

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.910
Let me borrow your classroom.

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:17.560
Go right ahead.

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:32.270
From that moment, you already had everything planned to this day.

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:34.220
Of course.

00:10:34.220 --> 00:10:38.120
I had already studied all of Gozaburo Kaiba's chess matches.

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:42.650
I also knew his mental state during competitions.

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:46.890
You look confident.

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:51.340
Six-time World Champ, show me what you can do!

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:53.090
Let's start.

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:05.470
That move...

00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:11.820
I played so that the board would match the previous games that he won.

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:13.750
But I set some traps.

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:30.200
He was shaken, so he fell for my traps.

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:44.110
If only...

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:49.700
If only my brother didn't defeat Gozaburo...

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:52.990
My brother would still be smiling.

00:11:57.600 --> 00:11:58.990
Wait, Mokuba!

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:06.600
If I'm able to change the past, you'll be smiling again like you used to!

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:10.610
Calm down, Mokuba.

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:13.400
We're not in the past.

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:16.710
This is Noah's virtual reality.

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:18.150
It's not real!

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:57.250
My turn.

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:58.620
I draw!

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:04.300
I summon Yowie in attack position.

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:13.100
Since you allowed Yowie to be summoned, you can't draw next turn.

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:17.010
My turn isn't over.

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:22.240
I activate the spell card Premature Burial!

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:31.530
By paying 800 life points, I revive a monster from my graveyard!

00:13:32.530 --> 00:13:39.130
I have to end this duel as fast as possible, but he gains monsters so easily!

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:46.570
You want to defeat me quickly so that you can go to your friends, but that's optimistic.

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:50.010
It won't happen.

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:57.380
It's that formation again!

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:01.980
Even if I attack his monster...

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:08.020
He'll tribute two monsters to activate his Deck Master's ability, Reflector Hole.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:19.020
Even if I manage to destroy his wall of monsters and attack him directly...

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:22.680
Go!  Obnoxious Celtic Guard!

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:35.530
When I take at least 1000 points of damage, I can summon another Ruklamba the Spirit King from my hand.

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:41.000
He'll Special Summon from his hand to increase his wall of monsters.

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:44.130
I can't attack carelessly.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:45.860
What's wrong?

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:49.200
Frozen in fear because there's nothing you can do?

00:14:50.560 --> 00:14:56.230
I'd love to see your Deck Master's ability at least once.

00:14:56.230 --> 00:14:59.800
But Kuriboh is useless.

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:05.310
Don't worry.  I trust you.

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:09.150
I end my turn.

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:19.530
Yeah!

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:20.770
Huh?

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:23.200
All right!  We're outside!

00:15:23.510 --> 00:15:24.600
But...

00:15:24.600 --> 00:15:26.980
We're still in the virtual world.

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:32.810
It's weird that this dungeon exists inside a fortress.

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:35.130
Stop babbling!

00:15:35.130 --> 00:15:37.560
C'mon!  Let's go find Shizuka!

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:40.480
Shizuka!

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:46.960
Somebody help me!

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:51.700
Shizuka!

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:53.460
Move to the side!

00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:55.630
No good!  She can't hear us!

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:57.440
Enough of this!

00:15:57.440 --> 00:15:58.860
Hey!  Over here-

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:09.130
Honda!

00:16:10.770 --> 00:16:12.500
Shizuka!  This way!

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:28.360
No problem.

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:31.420
Thank you, Otogi.

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:33.560
Don't mention it.

00:16:33.560 --> 00:16:35.540
It was thanks to me!

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:37.160
My turn!

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:42.910
Due to Yowie's effect, I can't draw this turn.

00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:50.580
Many texts on war strategy state that superior resources equals having the advantage.

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:55.150
In ancient China, "A large army can never be hurt."

00:16:55.150 --> 00:17:01.030
In France, "Victory depends on the size of the army."

00:17:01.260 --> 00:17:11.470
But a Prussian military theorist stated, "A superior number is only one element of victory."

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:14.140
That's enough!  Be quiet!

00:17:15.770 --> 00:17:21.010
If Obnoxious Celtic Guard attacks, and he uses his Deck Master's ability...

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:25.240
Celtic Guard's attack will strike me instead.

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:32.000
But he'll no longer have monsters to tribute to activate his Deck Master's ability.

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:37.710
Even if he doesn't use his Deck Master's ability on Celtic Guard...

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:40.430
...he'll have less monsters to tribute.

00:17:40.710 --> 00:17:44.100
This is dangerous, but it may create an opening.

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:47.520
Obnoxious Celtic Guard attacks Ipiria!

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:52.480
I activate my Deck Master's ability!

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:53.410
He used it!

00:17:54.370 --> 00:17:57.280
I tribute Ipiria and Yowie!

00:17:57.450 --> 00:17:59.850
Reflector Hole activates!

00:17:59.990 --> 00:18:02.480
Your monster's attack is negated!

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:06.030
And you take damage equal to its attack points!

00:18:06.240 --> 00:18:06.960
Here it comes!

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:35.800
You took damage for a second time.

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:37.660
I bet it hurts.

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:43.100
If you take another attack, your body won't survive the psychological damage.

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:49.180
You may lose your life before you lose all your life points.

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:54.370
But he no longer has any monsters to tribute-

00:18:57.030 --> 00:19:00.250
Why?  You should have no monsters to tribute!

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:08.500
By tributing Ruklamba, I can Special Summon monsters with 2000 or fewer attack points.

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:16.510
But their combined attack points must be 2000 or less.

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:20.530
You used Ruklamba's effect to summon them.

00:19:20.740 --> 00:19:24.470
Yes.  To summon Ruklamba and Wall of Illusion.

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:26.480
Wall of Illusion.

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:33.910
When a monster attacks that Wall, it's sent back to the owner's hand.

00:19:33.910 --> 00:19:39.330
“Total destruction stops the creation of a new enemy."

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:50.460
Even if he's attacked, he's already prepared to strike back.

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:54.520
No wonder he's called a "phantom."

00:19:57.150 --> 00:20:00.110
He has a Wall to send my monsters back to my hand.

00:20:00.110 --> 00:20:03.500
And he can summon Ruklamba when he takes damage.

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:09.610
And his Deck Master's ability sends the damage he takes back to me.

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:15.480
If I attack with Chimera, I'll have 0 life points.

00:20:16.760 --> 00:20:20.060
And why is my body damaged?

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:22.500
This duel is too dangerous.

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:26.500
I must go help my friends before it's too late!

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:30.080
What's wrong?  Are you sensing defeat?

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:32.720
No need to be ashamed.

00:20:32.950 --> 00:20:41.880
A Prussian general said, “A defeated general knows he will lose long before he sounds the retreat."

00:20:43.770 --> 00:20:45.800
Will you surrender?

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:50.890
If you do, I'll get your body.

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:57.510
You ran out of luck when you picked that useless Kuriboh as your Deck Master.

00:20:59.330 --> 00:21:01.430
It looks angry.

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:04.880
I won't let you insult Kuriboh!

00:21:05.680 --> 00:21:07.220
I end my turn!

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:12.420
It's my turn.

00:21:15.260 --> 00:21:17.360
I'm so happy.

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:21.390
I've been waiting for this moment for a long time.

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:27.060
When I attack, you'll die because you can't survive the mental shock.

00:21:27.060 --> 00:21:31.260
I can finally have a body!

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:37.560
I won't give up yet!

00:21:45.130 --> 00:21:48.550
Deepsea Warrior's strategy is punishing Yugi.

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:53.480
I'm in a huge pinch because Hitotsu-Me Giants have captured me!

00:21:53.480 --> 00:21:55.450
Are they going to eat me?

00:21:55.450 --> 00:21:58.120
Isn't this virtual reality?

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:00.160
I have to escape!

00:22:00.160 --> 00:22:03.360
Yugi's fighting hard, so I'll fight too!

00:22:03.360 --> 00:22:06.630
Don't lose against him, Yugi!

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:09.400
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Rainbow Arch's Counterattack

00:22:09.400 --> 00:22:10.960
Duel, standby!

00:22:14.660 --> 00:22:22.560
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:22.560 --> 00:22:31.510
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:31.840 --> 00:22:36.480
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:36.480 --> 00:22:40.450
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:48.420
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:48.420 --> 00:22:51.990
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:51.990 --> 00:22:56.760
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:56.760 --> 00:23:06.870
And walk it without stopping

00:23:06.870 --> 00:23:14.480
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:14.710 --> 00:23:23.450
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:31.430
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:31.430 --> 00:23:41.270
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
